#: data/com.github.peteruithoven.resizer.appdata.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Resizer is a simple, native elementary OS app for resizing one or more "
"images at once. It always maintains the aspect ratio and never upscales "
"images."
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.peteruithoven.resizer.appdata.xml.in:13
msgid "Features:"
